      {
        "index": 2,
        "text": "Water is collected, treated and distributed through a network of pipes. Some of those pipes had been installed many years earlier. A survey found leakage in several streets. Repairing the network would reduce waste, although the council still needed to compare the cost with other options.",
        "zh": "水被收集、处理，再通过管道网络输送出去。其中一些管道早在多年前就已安装。调查发现几条街道存在漏水。维修管网可以减少浪费，但地方议会仍需将成本与其他方案比较。",
        "start": 49.78666666666667,
