      {
        "index": 3,
        "text": "The engineer distinguished water conservation from water treatment. Filtration removes certain materials, while other stages deal with different forms of contamination. A proposed upgrade would be assessed before construction began. No one was asked to copy the treatment process at home; the discussion concerned the town's public infrastructure.",
        "zh": "工程师区分了节水与水处理。过滤去除某些物质，其他环节处理不同类型的污染。拟议的升级工程会在开工前接受评估。没有人被要求在家模仿处理流程；讨论关注的是小镇的公共基础设施。",
