        "index": 4,
        "text": "The council also invited farmers to discuss irrigation and seasonal demand. If rainfall remained low, restrictions might become necessary. Residents wanted a reliable supply without a large increase in charges. The final proposal combined pipe repairs, clearer information and a review of long-term capacity, rather than relying on a single solution.",
